Subject: [PATCH 1/9] Local fixes for the Verbose spike

- Validate level completion against the goal state (adapted from upstream PR #455,
  fixes the spurious 'Level completed' flashes of issues #402/#453 in editor mode).
- Typewriter: strip trailing periods from submitted phrases.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
