From 77903877cef35dd074757551355bd1a48bb41bef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@spike>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:19:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] Editor mode: validate completion in the infoview path
 too; stop retrying requests for closed documents

The infoview (editor mode) fetched the proof state through its own call site, bypassing the
completion validation added for the typewriter. It also retried every ContentModified error
immediately, which loops forever once the document is closed (observed at ~170 requests/s).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
